# LaTeX build artefacts - regenerate with:
#   D:\jepa_phase0\tools\tectonic\tectonic.exe -X compile main.tex --keep-intermediates --keep-logs
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.blg
*.synctex.gz
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.toc

# Loose Overleaf bundles in this directory are scratch builds.
# The negations that used to re-enable dist/ are gone: the root .gitignore
# records that superseded dist copies leaked a personal path in an embedded
# EVIDENCE.md, so they must NOT be tracked. Leaving the negations here
# overrode that rule and let 29.7 MB of superseded bundles accumulate. The
# validated ZIP is delivered to Downloads instead.
*.zip

# Backups
*.bak

__pycache__/
*.pyc
